title: "Halo — LLM Alignment Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  An LLM alignment and training toolkit extending the HuggingFace stack (TRL,
  Accelerate, Transformers) with advanced parallelism — Expert Parallelism,
  Context Parallelism, Tensor Parallelism, Expert Tensor Parallelism — and
  alignment methods including SMPO, Offline GRPO, and Environmental GRPO.
